WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.230
Meet Sam. Seventeen.

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.090
About to buy a first car.

3
00:00:03.743 --> 00:00:04.993
First, the deal is born.

4
00:00:04.843 --> 00:00:06.093
An advert. An offer.

5
00:00:05.943 --> 00:00:07.673
A counter-offer. Then,

6
00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:08.053
a deal.

7
00:00:08.744 --> 00:00:09.754
Then it gets tested.

8
00:00:10.184 --> 00:00:11.374
The dealer lied about a crash.

9
00:00:11.704 --> 00:00:12.894
Now the deal can be undone.

10
00:00:13.724 --> 00:00:14.774
And every deal ends.

11
00:00:15.144 --> 00:00:15.974
Paid and done.

12
00:00:16.424 --> 00:00:17.994
Broken. Or lost in a flood,

13
00:00:17.844 --> 00:00:19.174
with no one to blame.

14
00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:20.562
That's a contract.

15
00:00:20.412 --> 00:00:22.162
Born. Tested. Ended.

16
00:00:22.873 --> 00:00:23.883
Ride every line,

17
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:24.723
and take the quiz.

18
00:00:25.273 --> 00:00:26.623
This is The Contract Line.
